findings.what:
The G1 laning fix holds every RIFT laner on its road until 14:00 (src/sim/bots/bot.ts:50 LANE_PHASE_END = 840, lanePhase() at :240-243). During that phase:
- roams are blocked (:440 `b.gank && !lp`);
- cross-map defends are blocked (:421-426);
- objectives are allowed only from the adjacent lane, on an opening (:432-439);
- trades need an edge after a wave penalty (:376-385).
The result is very little fighting in the first 10–14 minutes.
Every queue fills its open seats with bots, so a human's lane opponent and the rest of the map look like this in most games.

