findings.fix:
Fold the Sunsplinter timing into CL-1's lane-hold rework: let the objective intent gather the adjacent roads and the grovehunter before spawn once their waves are shoved. Then:
- implement the designed Splinters stack (up to 3, modes_economy.md:399) so repeat takes matter;
- do the §9 follow-up: bots hold at a Needle and clear an empowered wave;
- add an objective-participation report to the soak (r09 §4.4).
No change to Longshade numbers is needed (ruling 4).

